{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のかばんの中にはポーチがいくつ入っているでしょう!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で〜〜でん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正解は6個入っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか邪魔なのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"な〜んでこんなにポーチを持ち歩いてるかは自分でも分かりません( ˙-˙ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっつもかばんの中がぐちゃぐちゃで困ってます。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに持ち歩いても使うものは限られてるのに…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これだからお片付けができない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"困ったさんだよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH9384K8AYE1D6HBC7FEFPJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい!ふぉ。"}],"source":"archive"}